# Next.js Font Loading

Use this skill to reduce layout shifts and flashes from font loading.

## Setup Options
1. CSS `@font-face` + `font-display: swap`
2. `next/font` for automatic optimization

## CSS Example
```css
@font-face {
  font-family: 'CustomFont';
  src: url('/fonts/custom.woff2') format('woff2');
  font-display: swap;
}
